```json
{
    "name": "read_page",
    "arguments": {
        "title": "2026 FIFA World Cup",
        "find": "won 2026 world cup"
    }
}
```

This response reads the Wikipedia article on the 2026 FIFA World Cup and extracts the relevant paragraph mentioning the winner.

